[ar:Laufey, Spencer Stewart]
[ti:Dear Soulmate]
[00:09.36] Do you live in New York City
[00:15.82] Or a couple towns away?
[00:23.89] Wherever you are, I'd jump in my car
[00:31.23] Just to see you today
[00:40.85] Will I meet you at a party?
[00:48.04] Sit next to you on a plane?
[00:56.08] Maybe I already know you and love you
[01:03.23] But will fall in love some day
[01:12.18] 
[01:14.72] Dear soulmate
[01:19.64] Do you think of me? 'Cause I do
[01:27.70] Do you have green eyes or are they brown like mine?
[01:35.98] Do you have a sister too?
[01:42.07] Dear soulmate
[01:47.22] One day I'll give this song to you
[01:54.25] 
[02:01.93] We will drive up to the mountains?
[02:07.82] Camp in a little tent?
[02:15.51] When the bears come at night
[02:19.69] Will you put up a fight?
[02:22.92] Or will you hide with me in my flashlight?
[02:32.83] Do you sleep on the right side?
[02:39.55] 
[02:41.78] 'Cause I prefer the left
[02:47.65] Will you make me butter toast?
[02:51.72] Perhaps a morning roast
[02:55.32] When I wake up and I'm sad?
[03:07.28] Dear soulmate
[03:11.79] Do you think of me? 'Cause I do
[03:19.30] Do you have blue eyes or are they brown like mine?
[03:27.53] Do you have a sister too?
[03:37.16] Dear soulmate
